| Template Directive | Module Import Statement |
|-------------------|------------------------|
| `<p-button>` | `import { ButtonModule } from 'primeng/button';` |
| `pInputText` | `import { InputTextModule } from 'primeng/inputtext';` |
| `pTextarea` | `import { TextareaModule } from 'primeng/textarea';` |
| `<p-select>` | `import { SelectModule } from 'primeng/select';` |
| `<p-multiselect>` | `import { MultiSelectModule } from 'primeng/multiselect';` |
| `<p-datepicker>` | `import { DatePickerModule } from 'primeng/datepicker';` |
| `<p-inputnumber>` | `import { InputNumberModule } from 'primeng/inputnumber';` |
| `<p-checkbox>` | `import { CheckboxModule } from 'primeng/checkbox';` |
| `<p-radiobutton>` | `import { RadioButtonModule } from 'primeng/radiobutton';` |
