### Panel with Header Template

In PrimeNG 21, `<p-panel>` uses `ng-template` with `#header`:

```html
<!-- ✅ CORRECT -->
<p-panel>
    <ng-template #header>
        <span>{{ 'title.myPanel' | translate }}</span>
    </ng-template>
</p-panel>

<!-- ❌ WRONG -->
<p-panel [header]="'title.myPanel' | translate"></p-panel>
```

