## Floating Labels with Form Controls

### PrimeNG Float Label Pattern

**MANDATORY**: Use `p-floatlabel` with `variant="on"` for all form inputs and dropdowns.

**CRITICAL**: When using `p-select` with `p-floatlabel`, **DO NOT** include a `placeholder` attribute.

```html
<p-floatlabel variant="on">
    <p-select
        id="partner"
        formControlName="partnerId"
        [options]="partners()"
        optionLabel="name"
        optionValue="id"
        [filter]="true"
        filterBy="name"
        [disabled]="isSubmitting()"
        class="w-full"
    />
    <label for="partner">{{ 'title.partner' | translate }} *</label>
</p-floatlabel>
```

