## ESLint & Code Quality

### ESLint Compliance

**MANDATORY**: All modified files must pass ESLint checks before submission.

```bash
npx eslint --fix src/app/**/*.ts
npx eslint --fix path/to/your/file.ts
```

**Requirements:**
- **Single quotes** in TypeScript
- **4-space indentation** consistently
- **Print width** 250
- **Selector prefix** `app-` (fix ESLint config if it says `'p'`)
- Run `npx eslint --fix` after code changes

