## Component Development Checklist

### Before Submitting Any Component:

- [ ] **No `standalone: true`** in decorator — it is implicit in Angular 21
- [ ] **Inline template** (`template:`) — no `templateUrl`
- [ ] **`inject()` function** — no constructor injection
- [ ] **`ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`** set on component
- [ ] **4-space indentation** throughout
- [ ] All input signals use `input()` function with appropriate transforms
- [ ] All output signals use `output()` function
- [ ] Computed signals for derived values
- [ ] Templates use Tailwind classes directly (no hardcoded hex/px)
- [ ] Modern control flow (`@if`, `@for`) — no `*ngIf`/`*ngFor`
- [ ] PrimeNG imported as **modules** (not standalone components)
- [ ] File-level JSDoc at line 1 with `@fileoverview` and `@author`
- [ ] Class-level JSDoc with `@class`, `@description`, `@example`, `@since`
- [ ] User confirmations use `FeedbackDialogService`, NOT browser dialogs
- [ ] HTTP errors handled globally — no local error handlers in subscribe calls
- [ ] **Translation keys** for all user-facing text, NO hardcoded English
- [ ] Translation keys added to all 4 language files (en, fr, es, pt)
- [ ] ESLint passes with `npx eslint --fix`

### Transform Requirements

- Boolean: `ComponentUtilsService.createBooleanTransform(defaultValue)`
- String: `ComponentUtilsService.createStringTransform(defaultValue)` or `createOptionalStringTransform()`
- Number: `ComponentUtilsService.createNumberTransform()` or `createNumberWithDefaultTransform()`
- Array: `ComponentUtilsService.createArrayTransform<T>()`
- Enum/Union: custom validation transforms

